{"translation":{"id":"aii_abt","name":"ܕܝܬܩܐ ܚܕܬܐ ܕܡܪܢ ܝܫܘܥ ܡܫܝܚܐ ܘܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ ܒܠܫܢܐ ܐܬܘܪܝܐ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"ABT","englishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic NT+Psalms","language":"aii","textDirection":"rtl","sha256":"1859152dbbffe55d2b7ac6d4c09fbad5a6416ca25359e69220bb358dac602444","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/books.json","numberOfBooks":28,"totalNumberOfChapters":410,"totalNumberOfVerses":10420,"languageName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic","languageEnglishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"aii_abt","name":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","commonName":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","title":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"08b7c4463dda6adc56b2c377f42d67ace350af655720940a2e395776a718fc6c","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":20,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ܠܪܝܫ ܓܘܕܐ ܕܙܡܪ̈ܐ. ܡܙܡܘܪܐ ܕܕܘܝܕ."]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ܓ̰ܲܘܸܒ ܠܘܼܟ݂ ܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܒܝܵܘܡܵܐ ܕܥܵܘܩܵܢܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡܲܪܸܡ ܠܘܼܟ݂ ܠܫܲܝܢܵܐ ܫܸܡܵܐ ܕܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ ܕܝܲܥܩܘܿܒ݂.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܫܲܕܸܪ ܗܲܝܲܪܬܘܼܟ݂ ܡ̣ܢ ܡܲܩܕܫܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܣܵܢܹܕ ܠܘܼܟ݂ ܡ̣ܢ ܨܸܗܝܘܿܢ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܕܵܟܹܪ ܠܟܠܵܝܗ‌ܝ ܩܘܼܪ̈ܒܵܢܘܼܟ݂،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܩܲܒܸܠܔ ܠܹܗ ܕܸܒ݂ܚܘܼܟ݂ ܡܘܼܩܕܵܐ. ܣܹܠܵܗ","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܝܵܗܒܹܠܔ ܠܘܼܟ݂ ܐܲܝܟ݂ ܠܸܒܘܼܟ݂،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܬܲܡܸܡ ܟܠܵܗ̇ ܬܲܚܡܲܢܬܘܼܟ݂.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܸܬ ܫܲܒܚܲܚ ܥܲܠܔ ܦܘܼܪܩܵܢܘܼܟ݂،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܒܫܸܡܵܐ ܕܐܲܠܵܗܲܢ ܒܸܬ ܡܲܪܡܲܚ ܐܵܬܵ‌ܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܬܲܡܸܡ ܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܠܟܠܵܝܗ‌ܝ ܛܠܵܒܝܵܬܘܼ̈ܟ݂.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܵܕܝܼܵܐ ܝܕܝܼܥ ܠܝܼ ܕܟܹܐ ܦܲܪܸܩ ܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܠܡܫܝܼܚܹܗ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܟܹܐ ܓ̰ܲܘܸܒ ܠܹܗ ܡ̣ܢ ܫܡܲܝܵܐ ܕܩܘܼܕܫܹܗ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܦܘܼܪ̈ܩܵܢܹܐ ܓܲܒܵܪܹ̈ܐ ܕܝܲܡܝܼܢܹܗ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܚܲܕܟܡܵܐ ܟܹܐ ܣܵܒܪܝܼ ܒܡܲܪ̈ܟܒ݂ܵܬܹ‌ܐ، ܘܚܲܕܟܡܵܐ ܒܣܘܼܣܵܘܵܬܹ̈‌ܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܝܼܢܵܐ ܐܲܚܢܲܢ ܒܫܸܡܵܐ ܕܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܐܲܠܵܗܲܢ ܒܸܬ ܡܲܕܟܸܪܲܚ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܵܢܝܼ ܒܪܝܼܟ ܠܗܘܿܢ ܘܢܦܝܼܠܔ ܠܗܘܿܢ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܝܼܢܵܐ ܐܲܚܢܲܢ ܩܝܼܡ ܠܲܢ ܘܟܠܹܐ ܠܲܢ ܬܪܘܼܨܵܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܝܵܐ ܡܵܪܝܵܐ، ܦܲܪܸܩ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡܲܠܟܵܐ ܓ̰ܲܘܸܒ ܠܲܢ ܒܝܵܘܡܵܐ ܕܩܵܪܲܚ.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/20.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/21.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/19.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":9}